			<div class="content" id="post-content-3772601">
									

<p>I've been tweaking this thing <em>way</em> more than I ought to, but I think I'm done now. If you read it when it first got published, there's only two parts I've really heavily changed:</p>
<ul>
<li>The final email from DeVorn has been swapped out for one from his employees (since DeVorn was sounding a bit like a two-bit super-villain, and this gave me a chance to provide a detailed depiction of what's going wrong with the SRAs)</li>
<li>O5-5's email underwent an overhaul. It is now at least <em>75%</em> more grandmotherly.</li>
</ul>
<p>Other than that, all I did was try to streamline the description a little to make the anomaly's effect more clear, and add a bit about DeVorn being a PoI that's still at large.</p>

