			<div class="content" id="post-content-4028509">
									

<p>I've made a few significant (though small) tweaks to the article:</p>
<ul>
<li>The <em>SS Sommerfeld</em> was now constructed to transport low-risk anomalies and anesthesized ontokineticists (reality-benders). This is to better fit into the lore theme of Scranton Reality Anchors being a way of addressing reality-benders.</li>
<li>I modified the discussion throughout the article regarding SRAs to better reflect this lore.</li>
<li>I made the footnotes visible (mobile users reported having difficulty sometimes seeing them), and displaced them above the O5-5 note.</li>
<li>Changed the O5-5's passcode to something a little more literary (and, in my mind, far more menacing). Also tweaked a few bits of her note that always bugged the heck out of me.</li>
</ul>

