			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3778679">
									

<p>That was definitely my intent, yeah. The anomaly is the malfunctioning SRAs and how they've interacted with a boatload of low-risk anomalies, resulting in an area of reality that's effectively just &quot;broken&quot;.</p>
<p>I put in the bit about the <em>RSV Silent Spring</em> to demonstrate just how fucked up this could get early on, but if I described all the anomalies going on inside of SCP-3241, I pretty much wouldn't know where to stop. It's basically a volume of space filled with real-life video-game glitches that are randomly changing at any given moment.</p>

