			<div class="content" id="post-content-3770957">
									

<p>There's nothing I hate quite so much as <a href="/scp-2832">being one-upped</a>.</p>
<p>Long stories about anomalous boats never get old, though. Part of me was disappointed the description of the anomaly's effects didn't come before the story, but by the time you got down there, it was obvious why: this isn't a story about a creepy boat, but about the tremendous fuckup that made the boat creepy in the first place.</p>
<p>And your dialogue is absolutely top-notch, specifically how DeVorn's self-corrections make him sound like a sleazy executive trying to keep his last shred of dignity and not piss off the last 1% of the world as he testifies before Congress. +1</p>

